WbevUHHRf0G58Q3YcHCJ8BKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwjB2OLSwtKWAxWbevUHHRf0G58Q3IcHCJ4BKAs",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這次點了雞白湯（有些款式有更新過的樣子，找不到蝦子跟雞肉）。\n店內裝潢氣派日式風，座位配置舒適，整體氛圍親民又不失質感。\n雞白湯湯頭濃郁帶有雞香，順口不過於油膩，搭配煙燻雞胸肉、雞腿等配料能增添口感層次，麵條Q彈、配料品質整體還不錯，但有些食客覺得味道沒有特別突出或令人驚艷的記憶點，整體風味偏中等略高於平均水平。如果有多一個溏心蛋會更加分！\n價格落在中等範圍，均消大約 300～400 元之間，環境乾淨與服務效率良好，用餐流程清楚方便。\n整體來說，龍鱗拉麵的雞白湯麵是款值得嘗試的日式拉麵選擇，適合喜歡濃郁雞湯但不想排長隊的食客，可以來這家。",null,[0,60]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4226915110401705650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVGxOSWEzZFNiazVzVmtSc2NGb3pjR0ZWVmtrelRGaFNSVlJYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4226915110401705650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVGxOSWEzZFNiazVzVmtSc2NGb3pjR0ZWVmtrelRGaFNSVlJYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4226915110401705650/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVGxOSWEzZFNiazVzVmtSc2NGb3pjR0ZWVmtrelRGaFNSVlJYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4226915110401705650/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVGxOSWEzZFNiazVzVmtSc2NGb3pjR0ZWVmtrelRGaFNSVlJYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4226915110401705650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVGxOSWEzZFNiazVzVmtSc2NGb3pjR0ZWVmtrelRGaFNSVlJYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4226915110401705650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVGxOSWEzZFNiazVzVmtSc2NGb3pjR0ZWVmtrelRGaFNSVlJYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,11686,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kTlNIa3dSbk5sVkRscFozcGFVVkkzTFhSRVRXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x534c9b93cf09c98f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmdNSHkwRnNlVDlpZ3paUVI3LXRETWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjl